{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-13837" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the value of ${\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{3x}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | ${e}^{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot {\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & ={\\frac{{u}^{2}}{3}|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04d4bd8d8457e7f0bda96f3b9dd270f7d5fcd27a8ef6617ca039f8939171431e"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{4}{3}"] ["math" "0"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{4}{3}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{2}{x{log}_{5}⁡(3x)}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{5}⁡(3x).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2}{x{log}_{5}⁡(3x)}\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\frac{1}{{log}_{5}⁡(3x)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡(3x)|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04d4bd8d8457e7f0bda96f3b9dd270f7d5fcd27a8ef6617ca039f8939171431e"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{5})\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡(3x)|+C"] ["math" "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡(3x)|+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡(3x)|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡({x}^{3})|+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-31402" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{5}⁡(3x)|+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the value of ${\\int }_{e}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $e$ | ${e}^{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{e}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x} & ={\\int }_{e}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|){|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04d4bd8d8457e7f0bda96f3b9dd270f7d5fcd27a8ef6617ca039f8939171431e"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["math" "e"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-49517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the value of ${\\int }_{4}^{16}\\frac{2}{x{log}_{4}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{4}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $4$ | $16$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{16}\\frac{2}{x{log}_{4}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{1}{{log}_{4}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|){|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡({2}^{2})\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 \\\\  & =4{ln}^{2}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04d4bd8d8457e7f0bda96f3b9dd270f7d5fcd27a8ef6617ca039f8939171431e"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["math" "4{ln}^{2}⁡2"] ["math" "8\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["math" "8{ln}^{2}⁡2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-73655" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4{ln}^{2}⁡2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{7}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {log}_{7}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{4}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04d4bd8d8457e7f0bda96f3b9dd270f7d5fcd27a8ef6617ca039f8939171431e"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "e8c441e192d948ee648ca17f4fc1a3eb09785cdb9d09178965d9f1bc8d8b9331"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot {log}_{7}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{4}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question